{"name":"Wonder Wish","hex":"#a97898","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"wonder","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A sense of awe, astonishment and curiosity, inspired by unexpected events, novel experiences and inexplicable circumstances, sometimes accompanied by surprise, shock or reverence.","Something that causes amazement or awe; a marvel."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To be affected with surprise or admiration; to be struck with astonishment; to be amazed; to marvel; often followed by at.","To ponder; to feel doubt and curiosity; to query in the mind."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wonder"},{"term":"wish","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A desire, hope, or longing for something or for something to happen.","An expression of such a desire, often connected with ideas of magic and supernatural power."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To desire; to want.","To hope (+ object clause with may or in present subjunctive)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wish"}],"entries":[{"title":"Wish","blocks":[{"text":"A wish is a hope or desire for something. In fiction, wishes can be used as plot devices. In folklore, opportunities for \"making a wish\" or for wishes to \"come true\" or \"be granted\" are themes that are sometimes used."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/I_samma_%C3%B6gonblick_var_hon_f%C3%B6rvandlad_till_en_undersk%C3%B6n_liten_%C3%A4lva.jpg/330px-I_samma_%C3%B6gonblick_var_hon_f%C3%B6rvandlad_till_en_undersk%C3%B6n_liten_%C3%A4lva.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wish"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/%E9%93%B6%E6%BB%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E6%A0%91_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-%E9%93%B6%E6%BB%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E6%A0%91_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x